Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person10:
	.string "The GREAT MARSH is so big! I spent all\n"
	.string "day there and only saw half.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person11:
	.string "Hyah! I train by walking through the\n"
	.string "marsh. The mud makes your legs strong!$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person12:
	.string "CLEFAIRY: Pippi!\p"
	.string "It's waving its little arms.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person13:
	.string "CRASHER WAKE is loud, but he's a great\n"
	.string "LEADER. You'll hear his laugh from the\l"
	.string "street.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person18:
	.string "I collect MOéMON from the marsh. Some\n"
	.string "of them only show up in the mud!$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person19:
	.string "The observatory lets you look at the\n"
	.string "whole marsh. I study the MOéMON from\l"
	.string "up there.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person20:
	.string "This city smells like rain and grass. I\n"
	.string "love it.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person24:
	.string "My parasol keeps the marsh mist off.\n"
	.string "My MOéMON hides under it too.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person25:
	.string "I've been trying to catch a rare\n"
	.string "MOéMON in the marsh for a week.\l"
	.string "Tomorrow's the day!$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Person26:
	.string "The roads around PASTORIA are muddy.\n"
	.string "Good for training your footwork!$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Sign5:
	.string "PASTORIA CITY\p"
	.string "The city by the marsh, where nature\n"
	.string "runs wild.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Sign6:
	.string "PASTORIA CITY MOéMON GYM\p"
	.string "LEADER: CRASHER WAKE\p"
	.string "The masked wave!$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Sign7:
	.string "GREAT MARSH\p"
	.string "Rare MOéMON live in the mud and the\n"
	.string "reeds.$"

Sinnoh_PastoriaCity_Text_Sign9:
	.string "SAFARI GAME\p"
	.string "The GREAT MARSH's gate is just ahead.$"

